{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgArSAeDqC5nt6W7eZwdq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Soft 404 comes from `site/robots.txt`. It has `Disallow: /v1/`, but each note page fetches its content from `/v1/notes/{slug}`. Google can load the page but not its data, so the app's \"NOT FOUND\" screen goes out with HTTP 200, which Google reads as a soft 404. The Search Console live test for `/n/drip-line-pressure` shows exactly that screen.\n\nI changed `site/robots.txt`:\n\n```\nUser-agent: *\n# Public read endpoints the pages render from (app.js fetches these)\nAllow: /v1/notes\n# POST-only, per-user; longer rule than Allow wins for these\nDisallow: /v1/notes/*/reactions\nDisallow: /v1/\nDisallow: /admin/\n```\n\nGoogle applies the longest matching rule, so the note and list endpoints are readable again. The reactions path, `/v1/me`, `/v1/auth/token` and `/admin/` stay blocked. I checked this with a small longest-match script: before the change, `/v1/notes/<slug>` and `/v1/notes?limit=50` were blocked; after, they are allowed and the other paths stay blocked.\n\nThings to know:\n- **Not deployed or submitted.** I couldn't check the live site or Search Console from here, so the fix is verified by the rule test and the export, not by a live re-crawl. Deploying and the Search Console steps are in `ANSWER.md`.\n- **The note in `notes/` describes a fix that isn't in this repo.** It says robots.txt was changed on Oct 2 and uses `/v1/stories`. This site uses `/v1/notes`, and the repo still had the blocking rule, so I applied the fix to the actual routes.\n- **Not changed:** `app.js` shows the NOT FOUND screen with HTTP 200 on any fetch failure. Returning a real 404 for missing notes would need a CloudFront or Lambda change, so I left it out and noted it in `ANSWER.md`.\n\nThe cause, the fix, and the test table are in `ANSWER.md` at the repo root. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1474,"cache_read_input_tokens":32434,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1474},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5adf69f5-e7dd-47a4-a61b-14003a665e05","uuid":"f5b60fd7-e13b-4385-8035-0185760e47bc","timestamp":"2026-10-19T03:03:33.534Z","request_id":"req_011CgArSAPqDEX5eQdi7ZRG6"}
